1 polymer     man 'Contact-dependent inhibitor A' 10476.635 2 ? ? 'toxin domain' 
;The cloned fragment  corresponds to Val3035-Lys3289 of the full-length protein (CdiA-CT). The final purified ternary complex was treated with trypsin that cleaved CdiA-CT after Lys3196.
;
2 polymer     nat 'Elongation factor Tu'          4804.528  2 ? ? N-terminal     
;Short trypsin treatment prior to crystallization cleaved EF-Tu after Arg45 and after Arg59. The sample is a mixture of tufA and tufB gene products (GI 947838, 948482).
;
3 polymer     nat 'Elongation factor Tu'          36966.277 2 ? ? C-terminal     
;Short trypsin treatment prior to crystallization cleaved EF-Tu after Arg45 and after Arg59. The sample is a mixture of tufA and tufB gene products (GI 947838, 948482).
;
